8,"dur":6.72,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Person_repairing_data_glove_lab_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Person_repairing_data_glove_lab_202607101941.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was a retreat into a perfectly managed world.","kw":["retreat","perfectly","managed","world"],"ch":10},{"t":42.03,"dur":6,"clip":"10_vr-winter/AI_historical_reconstruction_1995_202607101901.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/AI_historical_reconstruction_1995_202607101901.mp4","in":2.88,"text":"In reality, we were moving into a world where everyone would be perfectly isolated.","kw":["reality","moving","world","where","everyone","would","perfectly","isolated"],"ch":10},{"t":49.93,"dur":6,"clip":"10_vr-winter/VR_demo_tape_degrading_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/VR_demo_tape_degrading_202607101941.mp4","in":0,"text":"It was a promise of a new world, where we could escape the limits.","kw":["promise","world","where","could","escape","limits"],"ch":10},{"t":61.66,"dur":7,"clip":"10_vr-winter/User_removing_VR_headset_tired_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/User_removing_VR_headset_tired_202607101941.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1996, we believed we thought we could escape into a perfect digital world.","kw":["believed","thought","could","escape","perfect","digital","world"],"ch":10},{"t":69.86,"dur":2.4,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Unsold_VR_headsets_in_warehouse_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Unsold_VR_headsets_in_warehouse_202607101941.mp4","in":3.56,"text":"A virtual world where we could drift away.","kw":["virtual","world","where","could","drift","away"],"ch":10},{"t":75.11,"dur":2.6,"clip":"10_vr-winter/VR_headset_on_metal_shelf_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/VR_headset_on_metal_shelf_202607101941.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"A retreat into a world where nothing was real.","kw":["retreat","world","where","nothing","real"],"ch":10},{"t":79.29,"dur":4,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Auction_of_obsolete_VR_headsets_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Auction_of_obsolete_VR_headsets_202607101941.mp4","in":0,"text":"It was a dream of a perfectly connected world.","kw":["dream","perfectly","connected","world"],"ch":10},{"t":85.9,"dur":5,"clip":"10_vr-winter/VR_headset_on_metal_shelf_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/VR_headset_on_metal_shelf_202607101941.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was a dangerous illusion.","kw":["dangerous","illusion"],"ch":10},{"t":92.16,"dur":5.6,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","in":0,"text":"Imagine stepping completely inside your favorite video games. This is not science fiction. This is reality.","kw":["imagine","stepping","completely","inside","your","favorite","video","games"],"ch":10},{"t":98.67,"dur":4,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","in":5.48,"text":"The graphics are absolutely breathtaking, bringing the future right into your living room.","kw":["graphics","absolutely","breathtaking","bringing","future","right","your","living"],"ch":10}],"duck":[[0,9.3,0.55],[9.55,18.8,0.28],[19.98,30.23,0.28],[33.18,40.15,0.28],[42.03,48.28,0.28],[49.93,56.18,0.28],[61.66,68.91,0.28],[69.86,72.51,0.28],[75.11,77.96,0.28],[79.29,83.54,0.28],[85.9,91.15,0.28],[92.16,98.01,0.28],[98.67,102.92,0.28]],"coverage":0.439,"used":18,"pool":41,"speech":0.658,"eras":[10],"filmName":"SWEEP 24 FILM ch10"}